get, the matrix of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spectral graph theory (B·Bᵀ = L, Godsil–Royle §8.3) and NetworkX’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"incidence_matrix(oriented=True)"},{"text":". It conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedHypergraph"},{"text":", so the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hypergraphs"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"algorithms (B- and F-connection, components, the clique expansion) run on it unchanged; it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedGraph"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"title":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}